# Git remotes

- **Push target:** always `vibecoded` → `https://github.com/Dombrero/Pulsar4x-Vibecoded.git`
- **Never** push to `origin` (`Pulsar4xDevs/Pulsar4x`) — no write access; do not attempt it
- Default push command when the user asks to push: `git push -u vibecoded HEAD`
- Branch tracking should stay on `vibecoded/<branch>` (e.g. `vibecoded/dombreros_version_AI_vibecoded`)
